        "problem": "Which of the following diagrams shows all the $10$th roots of unity?",
        "worked_solution": "Geometrically, the $10$th roots of unity have the following properties:\n\n- all of them lie on the unit circle centered in the origin,\n\n- one of the roots is $1,$ corresponding to the point $(1,0)$ on the complex plane,\n\n- the roots form a regular decagon (regular $10$-sided polygon).\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is the following:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13980994/assets/82682434de1fe7e9c7f086334f0ef7e0a7b2fde3d64efd7234ea10f1fb6c3b4f.png)",
